    "text": "You’re out here roleplaying constitutional law like it’s fan fiction. ‘Federalize California’? That’s not how federalism works, it’s how civics illiteracy performs.\nNewsom’s playing chess while you’re still chewing on the rulebook like it’s beef jerky. MAGA’s scared because he doesn’t need a grievance tour, he’s got strategy, speech, and seats in play. Stay mad.\nAnd what do you think Texas is doing, LOL? They’re mid-decade rigging congressional maps like it’s a clearance sale on democracy. Newsom’s just matching energy with actual legal footing and voter support. If you’re going to cry foul, at least learn the rules of the game you’re losing.",
